# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

## Product Name

# SlicerFlow Copilot

### From Natural Language to Verified and Reproducible 3D Medical Imaging Workflows

---

## 1. Product Overview

SlicerFlow Copilot is an AI-assisted workflow automation system built around 3D Slicer.

The system enables users to describe a medical imaging task using natural language. The AI Copilot converts the request into a structured workflow, validates the requested operations, executes supported steps through 3D Slicer automation, verifies the output of each step, and generates a reproducible case-processing record.

The product is designed as a clinical imaging workflow and research prototype.

### Core Product Flow

User Intent
↓
AI Copilot
↓
Structured Workflow Plan
↓
Command and Parameter Validation
↓
Pipeline Orchestrator
↓
3D Slicer Execution
↓
Step-by-Step Verification
↓
Output Generation
↓
Reproducibility Manifest and Case Report

