# 12. Key Differentiator

The central product differentiator is:

# Verified AI-Assisted Workflow Execution

The system is not simply:

> AI → Execute Command

Instead:

```text
USER INTENT
      ↓
AI INTERPRETATION
      ↓
STRUCTURED PLAN
      ↓
COMMAND VALIDATION
      ↓
3D SLICER EXECUTION
      ↓
OUTPUT VERIFICATION
      ↓
PASS / WARNING / BLOCK
      ↓
REPRODUCIBLE REPORT
```

The AI proposes the workflow.

The system validates the workflow.

3D Slicer executes supported operations.

The Verification Engine checks results.

The human reviews the final output.

---

# 13. Success Metrics

The MVP will be considered successful if it can demonstrate:

### Workflow Automation

* A supported workflow can be executed end-to-end.

### Natural Language Interaction

* A user can describe a supported task in natural language.

### Structured Planning

* The request is converted into a valid structured workflow.

### Validation

* Invalid commands or incompatible workflows are detected.

### Verification

* At least one major processing output is automatically validated.

### Reproducibility

* Every run produces a workflow manifest.

### Demonstration Quality

The system clearly demonstrates:

Input → Intent → Plan → Validation → Execution → Verification → Output

