# 14. Risks

## Risk 1 — Over-Reliance on AI

### Mitigation

Use structured commands and schema validation.

---

## Risk 2 — Too Many Supported Workflows

### Mitigation

Support only a small number of polished workflows during the hackathon.

---

## Risk 3 — 3D Slicer Automation Complexity

### Mitigation

Use tested Python scripting examples and build one workflow at a time.

---

## Risk 4 — AI Hallucinated Commands

### Mitigation

Only allow commands from a predefined supported command registry.

---

## Risk 5 — Medical Safety Claims

### Mitigation

Clearly label the project as:

> Research and workflow automation prototype. Outputs require qualified human review and are not intended for autonomous clinical decision-making.

